flowchart TD
  U[User] -- "login · MFA · passkey" --> IDP[Identity provider<br/>OIDC · sessions · MFA]
  IDP --> UD[(Users · credentials<br/>replicated)]
  IDP --> RT[(Refresh tokens<br/>hashed · rotated)]
  IDP -. publishes keys .-> JWKS[JWKS endpoint]
  U -- access token --> GW[Gateway]
  GW -. caches keys .-> JWKS
  GW --> S1[Service A]
  GW --> S2[Service B]
  S1 -. "can user X edit doc 7?" .-> PS[Permission service<br/>relationship tuples · cache]
  S1 <-- mTLS identity --> S2
